│ care from Kaiser Permanente Colorado were assigned randomly to one of the three Family Connections (FC)              │
│ interventions: FC-workbook, FC-group, or FC-interactive voice response (IVR) counseling. MAIN OUTCOME MEASURES Child │
│ BMI z-scores, as well as symptoms of eating disorders and body image, were assessed at baseline, 6 months, and 12    │
│ months. RESULTS The BMI z-scores of children assigned to the FC-IVR intervention were the only ones that decreased   │
