  registers in a weight loss treatment program for children: a description of the ETIOBE personal digital assistant     
  program", "abstract": "Childhood obesity is a significant health problem in western societies. Self-monitoring        
  techniques, such as the use of dietary and physical activity registers, are considered to be central to               
