  years with 7-month follow-up. Meets all inclusion criteria.", "confidence": "high"},                                  
      326: {"decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "RCT of lifestyle intervention (nutrition and exercise counseling) in   
  overweight children aged 7-9 years with 1-year follow-up. Meets all inclusion criteria.", "confidence": "high"},      
      348: {"decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "RCT of physical training in obese children aged 7-11 years with        
  8-month total follow-up (two 4-month periods). Meets all inclusion criteria.", "confidence": "high"},                 
