  problem-solving training in obese children with 6-month follow-up. Assuming age fits criteria based on typical        
  pediatric obesity studies.", "confidence": "medium"},                                                                 
      386: {"decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "RCT of family-based behavioral treatment with stimulus control or      
