  aged 9-10 years with 24-week (~6-month) follow-up. Meets all inclusion criteria.", "confidence": "high"},             
      394: {"decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "RCT of school-based obesity prevention program in children aged 9-11   
  years with 6-month follow-up. Meets all inclusion criteria.", "confidence": "high"},                                  
      395: {"decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "RCT of group office-visit intervention for overweight children in      
  grades 3-5 (approx. 8-11 years) with 9-month follow-up. Meets all inclusion criteria.", "confidence": "high"},        
      399: {"decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "RCT of water consumption promotion intervention in second and third    
